<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>SSH - 标签 - DebugTalk</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/tags/SSH/</link><description>DebugTalk</description><generator>Hugo 0.167.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-beta-mukxzari</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</managingEditor><webMaster>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 11:47:32 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://debugtalk.com/tags/SSH/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>深入浅出 Git 权限校验</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/head-first-git-authority-verification/</link><pubDate>Wed, 15 Jun 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/head-first-git-authority-verification/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;p&gt;借助上次“掉坑”的经历，我对Git权限校验的两种方式重头进行了梳理，形成了这篇总结记录。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;在本地计算机与GitHub（或GitLab）进行通信时，传输主要基于两种协议，&lt;code&gt;HTTPS&lt;/code&gt;和&lt;code&gt;SSH&lt;/code&gt;，对应的仓库地址就是&lt;code&gt;HTTPS URLs&lt;/code&gt;和&lt;code&gt;SSH URLs&lt;/code&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>GitHub 权限校验失败给我的启发</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/trap-in-GitHub-authority-verification/</link><pubDate>Tue, 14 Jun 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/trap-in-GitHub-authority-verification/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Development/">Development</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="背景描述"&gt;&lt;span&gt;背景描述&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af%e6%8f%8f%e8%bf%b0" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.